  difficulty: 2
  description: "A single hollow stem curling into a shape not unlike a musical clef,
    humming faintly, ominously, when air passes through its open coil.\n\nIt hums
    loveliest in neglect, and that's no coincidence \u2014 something about its thriving
    in poor conditions pulls a little life from whatever\u2019s growing near it."
  descriptionSecondary: "While planted, it periodically drains a small amount of
    water from nearby plants' pots \u2014 a minor, constant debuff on its neighbours,
    scaled down from whatever the tree does on a much larger scale."
